# G1-EDA-HOST-STATUS-02 retained evidence.
#
# emitted/manifest.json names each emitted script by the SHA-256 of its own
# bytes, and the harness/agreement transcripts quote those digests. With
# core.autocrlf=true a fresh Windows checkout would rewrite these files to
# CRLF and every recorded digest would stop matching the file on disk. Pin
# the whole directory to its committed bytes; the same "CRLF daemon" cure the
# root .gitattributes documents, scoped to this packet so no shared list moves.
* -text
